{"3896300": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Toll Booth Simulator", "steam_appid": 3896300, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4506650], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punch in. Let the madness begin. You're the sole toll booth operator on a remote desert highway. At first, it’s routine: press the button, lift the gate, collect the cash. But routine doesn’t last long out here. You plant strange seeds. You grow bizarre fruit. Soon, you're mixing mocktails and selling drinks to whoever rolls up to the gate. Run your station. Grow your crops. Cook. Serve. Survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896300/extras/7741ad1ffc6a4da26e90256f5777d38b.poster.avif?t=1786635174\" width=800 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896300/extras/7741ad1ffc6a4da26e90256f5777d38b.webm?t=1786635174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896300/extras/7741ad1ffc6a4da26e90256f5777d38b.mp4?t=1786635174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage traffic through your toll gate. Accept payment, deny weirdos, or let them through just to see what happens. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant exotic seeds. Harvest the fruits of your labor. <strong>Mix and sell cocktails</strong> with unpredictable and often alarming side effects. Some customers come back for more. Others don’t.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896300/extras/43a2ce5b7494f1a94cef394571e5a6b7.poster.avif?t=1786635174\" width=800 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896300/extras/43a2ce5b7494f1a94cef394571e5a6b7.webm?t=1786635174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896300/extras/43a2ce5b7494f1a94cef394571e5a6b7.mp4?t=1786635174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Farm your ingredients. Plant exotic seeds, water them with a tractor, and harvest bizarre fruits from mutating trees. Everything you need for the drinks... or something else entirely.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896300/extras/187a557484213ad549eef2cf1d5808d4.poster.avif?t=1786635174\" width=800 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896300/extras/187a557484213ad549eef2cf1d5808d4.webm?t=1786635174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896300/extras/187a557484213ad549eef2cf1d5808d4.mp4?t=1786635174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break into houses, grab valuables, and escape before the sirens catch up. Some loot is worth the risk. Some not so much.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punch in. Let the madness begin. You're the sole toll booth operator on a remote desert highway. At first, it’s routine: press the button, lift the gate, collect the cash. But routine doesn’t last long out here. You plant strange seeds. You grow bizarre fruit. Soon, you're mixing mocktails and selling drinks to whoever rolls up to the gate. Run your station. Grow your crops. Cook. Serve. Survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896300/extras/7741ad1ffc6a4da26e90256f5777d38b.poster.avif?t=1786635174\" width=800 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896300/extras/7741ad1ffc6a4da26e90256f5777d38b.webm?t=1786635174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896300/extras/7741ad1ffc6a4da26e90256f5777d38b.mp4?t=1786635174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage traffic through your toll gate. Accept payment, deny weirdos, or let them through just to see what happens. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant exotic seeds. Harvest the fruits of your labor. <strong>Mix and sell cocktails</strong> with unpredictable and often alarming side effects. Some customers come back for more. Others don’t.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896300/extras/43a2ce5b7494f1a94cef394571e5a6b7.poster.avif?t=1786635174\" width=800 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896300/extras/43a2ce5b7494f1a94cef394571e5a6b7.webm?t=1786635174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896300/extras/43a2ce5b7494f1a94cef394571e5a6b7.mp4?t=1786635174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Farm your ingredients. Plant exotic seeds, water them with a tractor, and harvest bizarre fruits from mutating trees. Everything you need for the drinks... or something else entirely.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896300/extras/187a557484213ad549eef2cf1d5808d4.poster.avif?t=1786635174\" width=800 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896300/extras/187a557484213ad549eef2cf1d5808d4.webm?t=1786635174\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896300/extras/187a557484213ad549eef2cf1d5808d4.mp4?t=1786635174\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break into houses, grab valuables, and escape before the sirens catch up. Some loot is worth the risk. Some not so much.</p>", "short_description": "You tried to escape prison but got caught. Instead of prison, they gave you a debt. Manage a toll booth on a desert highway. Check passports, take payments, and decide who passes. Grow fruit, mix mocktails, sell drinks, and dodge the cops. The only way to earn freedom is by paying off your debt.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896300/745a728689cbfecd9347b900dab32f63aaa8107d/header.jpg?t=1786635174", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896300/aa78a2426bd4383309c3457166e3861df7d42b97/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786635174", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3896300/aa78a2426bd4383309c3457166e3861df7d42b97/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786635174", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-9400F / AMD Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 960 / AMD Radeon RX 560<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage